Description: Retrieves and normalizes scholarly article metadata and
    abstracts from the 'Crossref' REST API
    <https://www.crossref.org/documentation/retrieve-metadata/rest-api/>,
    the 'OpenAlex' API <https://help.openalex.org/> and the 'Scopus' Search
    API <https://dev.elsevier.com/sc_apis.html>. Provides bibliographic
    searches, cursor pagination, publication date and author filtering,
    abstract retrieval by Digital Object Identifier (DOI), cached batch
    enrichment, merging of duplicate records, metadata-quality audits,
    reproducible search snapshots, local archives with integrity
    verification, and export to
    comma-separated values (CSV), 'BibTeX' and 'RIS' citation files.
    Network requests support configurable timeouts and test callbacks.
    'Scopus' searches require an 'Elsevier' API key; 'Crossref' queries do
    not. 'OpenAlex' supports limited keyless searches and authenticated
    pagination.
